# With a Forest in play the player chooses which land the Turf returns (CR 603.6a): on turn 3 the Turf itself, leaving the
# untapped Forest (it still taps for G); on turn 5 the replayed Turf returns the Forest instead and stays. A Turf that
# stays has entered tapped (CR 614.1c), so its mana ability is refused that turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Gruul Turf
Forest x5
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Gruul Turf.Play
Bot1.Choose(Gruul Turf)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 1
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Gruul Turf.Play
Bot1.Choose(Forest)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Gruul Turf.Activate
? Bot1.Battlefield.Gruul Turf.Tapped = true

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Gruul Turf
Bot1.LandsPlayed = 1
